      "message": "I did not catch this before (build error), but we can not remove @UnsupportedAppUsage because we have detected that this class in this library is being used/extended by vendors. Removing this will break their ability to compile this code.\n\nUnfortunately, this means we will need to just live with the bad name of Cf, even though this will be used for all supplementary services.\n\nPlease rename SS-\u003eCf and leave a comment saying that this is used for all supplementary services, not just call forwarding but the name must stay consistent for compatibility.",
